+FILE/COMMENT
 SYNTHETIC TEST FILE - NOT EPN DATA
 
 The EPN Central Bureau did not answer when the tests of pyarchinit-photogrammetry were written
 (2026-10-27), so this file is not a capture of the EPN multi-year solution. It has the layout of
 the IGc20.ssc of the IGS (SINEX 2.02, SOLUTION/EPOCHS and SOLUTION/ESTIMATE, reference epoch
 2015.0 here) and numbers that were made up: the approximate positions of the site logs (M3G)
 moved by a few centimetres, velocities close to the real ones of the stations of Rome, and a
 discontinuity of M0SE (solution 2 from 2023, day 152).
